  /// SaveRule · an error message
  /// shown through ValidationException
  error "There is already a copy of that rule here — change that one." => "توجد هنا نسخة من تلك القاعدة بالفعل، عدّل تلك النسخة.";
  /// SaveRule · an error message
  /// placeholders: {original.Name} = original.Name (string)
  /// shown through ValidationException
  error "“{original.Name}” is locked — it runs as the app wrote it, and nobody replaces it." => "«{original.Name}» مقفلة: تعمل كما كتبها التطبيق، ولا يستبدلها أحد.";

